WEBVTT

32:30.767 --> 32:33.186
(ROBERT LAUGHING)

32:33.311 --> 32:35.647
- WOMAN: He likes that.
- (WOMEN LAUGHING)

32:37.190 --> 32:40.109
This is for the king from Lord Stark.

32:40.235 --> 32:42.278
- (ROBERT LAUGHS)
- Should I leave it with...

32:42.403 --> 32:45.990
- Shhh. Listen.
- (WOMEN LAUGHING)

32:46.115 --> 32:48.660
Do you hear them?

32:50.828 --> 32:54.457
How many do you think
are in there with him? Huh?

32:55.416 --> 32:57.043
- Guess.
- Three.

32:57.168 --> 32:59.212
- (LAUGHTER)
- Four.
